[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_WINDIGO_INVINCIBLE]
Windigo (Titan)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_WINDIGO_INVINCIBLE_desc]
Ponies survived the last ice age. We’re certainly capable of surviving this one. All depends on whether or not we’re able to learn from our mistakes.
§g“When we were talking about ‘Cold War’, that’s definitely not what we meant!”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_WINDIGO_INVINCIBLE_short]
Windigo

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_WINDIGO_INVINCIBLE]
风之魔 (泰坦)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_WINDIGO_INVINCIBLE_desc]
小马们在上一个冰河时代中幸存了下来。我们当然也能在这个时代中幸存下来。一切都取决于我们是否能够从我们的错误中学到东西。
§g“当我们说‘冷战’的时候，绝对不是这个意思！”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_WINDIGO_INVINCIBLE_short]
风之魔
